{"about_the_game":"n a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a Bloodhauler.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour machine \u2014 heavy, armored, and fitted with a spiked grinder \u2014 rolls into the fog.<br />\r\nYou crush, slice, and tear through monsters. Blood hits the hood, floods the road.<br />\r\nYou\u2019re not here for glory \u2014 you're here to fill the quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou haul back gallons of blood. It\u2019s offloaded. Coins clink.<br />\r\nYou spend them on upgrades: tougher armor, a meaner engine, sharper steel.<br />\r\nAll to survive the next run \u2014 and meet the next quota.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThen it\u2019s back into the unknown. New zones to explore. Rarer beasts to hunt.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1752681846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1752681846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/d014b412296abba5e13cac8360ec20ef0074f803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752681846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/d014b412296abba5e13cac8360ec20ef0074f803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752681846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and gore.\r\nPlayers will drive a car to run over monsters, which is accompanied by intense blood splatter, dismemberment, and other graphic effects. All of this takes place in a dark, oppressive horror atmosphere. This content may be disturbing to sensitive players and is not recommended for children or teenagers."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"n a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a Bloodhauler.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour machine \u20